#ASSERT NOT `the role is a responsible position` `a company` `shareholder only`
#ASSERT `the role is a responsible position` `a society` `treasurer`
#ASSERT NOT `the role is a responsible position` `a partnership` `manager`
#ASSERT `the role is a responsible position` `a limited liability partnership` `manager`

