§ `Penalties and s 9A`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `selling before plans are approved` EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `taking anonymous money` EQUALS 100000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `holding a responsible position after fraud or while bankrupt` EQUALS 50000

#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `holding a responsible position after fraud or while bankrupt` EQUALS 36
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `holding a responsible position after a money laundering conviction` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `breaching the rules at the rules' maximum` EQUALS 6

#ASSERT `the maximum total fine` `disobeying a section 8 direction` 30 EQUALS 40000
#ASSERT `the maximum total fine` `taking anonymous money` 10 EQUALS 100000

#ASSERT `the maximum composition sum` `taking anonymous money` EQUALS 50000

